  "body": "`crates/app/tests/lathe_thread_travel.rs` (from #643) broke on main after two later merges:\n\n1. **Compile (E0063):** #639 added `hand: ThreadHand` to `OpParams::Threading`. The test now sets `hand: ThreadHand::Right`.\n2. **Fixture:** 53e4aebb moved the built-in Lathe's X min from `0.0` to `-2.5`. The over-travel test's `replacen(\"\\\"min\\\": 0.0, \\\"max\\\": 320.0\", …)` stopped matching, and its own `assert_ne!` guard failed. It now replaces only `\"max\": 320.0`, which only the X stroke has (Z is ±615), and leaves the shipped min alone.\n\n**Tests:** `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test lathe_thread_travel`: 2 passed. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n**Not exercised:** other suites (test-only change to one file).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #711\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
